sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant E as Express App
    participant R as User Router
    participant M as Auth or Multer
    participant H as Controller
    participant D as MongoDB
    participant S as Response
    C->>E: HTTP request
    E->>R: Route matching
    R->>M: Run route middleware when configured
    M-->>R: Attach user or parsed upload
    R->>H: Invoke controller
    H->>D: Query or update model
    D-->>H: Result
    H->>S: ApiResponse or error
    S-->>C: HTTP response
